## Printed
heading: FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLES
heading: Can You Solve Them?
number: No 24
intro: Today's cross word puzzle, the twenty-fourth in FUN'S series, is contributed by Ernest A. Grant of Washington, D. C. Can you solve it? Fill in the small squares with words corresponding to the list of clews and definitions given herewith, allowing one letter of the word to each small square. The solution to the puzzle will be published in next week's FUN.
